SWEET FG F1 (patch 0156, docs/research/47 stage F1): a READ-ONLY look at HSI2C12, the I2C bus of the Pixel 6's MAX77759 fuel gauge. Boot-arg sweetfg=1 (default off), ADT /sweet-fg (tools/mkadt.py, boards with fg_usi in board.json: oriole). After sweetfgdelay seconds (default 60) it prints the CMU_PERIC1 USI12 clock words, the sysreg USI12 mode, the SCL/SDA pad state and, only if both USI12 gates (ipclk_5, pclk_5) read as on, the HSI2C12 registers and its USI block. No register write, no I2C transaction.

